	// Then we need to read the SD card at an SPI baud rate of 192 KBps = 1.536 Mbps
	// Since SPI1 takes clock from APB2 which is 96 MHz/96 Mbps, the maximum prescaler according to APB2/prescaler = SPI baud rate
